WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 41 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
He isn't faking it.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
He truly has no idea how terrifying his power is.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.760
The dragon still drained.

4
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.760
Its magic hasn't returned yet.

5
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.760
This is still my game.

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.760
So I misread your potential.

7
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.760
So I made a mistake. What of it?

8
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.760
I am the strongest dragon knight in all four orders.

9
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.760
Might makes right!

10
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.760
Does anyone here have a problem with that?

11
00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.760
The four orders. It's the three orders now really.

12
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.760
Ever since the Grand Duchess Montel took her father's seat,

13
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.760
she hasn't shown her face at a single gathering.

14
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.760
Exactly. She's never respected his authority.

15
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.760
If she were here right now,

16
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:42.760
Mordrek wouldn't dare run his mouth like this.

17
00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.940
Seraphina!

18
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.940
That little girl hides in her castle because she's terrified of me.

19
00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.940
I am the true head of the four orders.

20
00:00:53.940 --> 00:01:07.190
Terrified of you?

21
00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:11.190
Or maybe she just refuses to stand in the same filth as you?

22
00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:13.190
Listen to me all of you!

23
00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:14.190
I'm nobody.

24
00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:16.190
Anyone here could knock me flat with one swing.

25
00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.190
But even a nobody can see this kind of honor

26
00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.190
isn't worth the dirt on your boots.

27
00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:23.190
Walk out with me.

28
00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:24.190
Right now!

29
00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:26.190
Stop dancing to his tune!
